      en: ["Located in the West Coast Division, near Juffureh.", "Cliffs rise up to 12 meters above the river surface.", "Center for community-based ecotourism since 1999.", "Primary observation point for the African Manatee.", "Surrounding soils are alluvial and highly fertile.", "Known for sheltering rare orchid species in the forest."],
